# GitHub answers 404 to unauthenticated requests for the stargazers listing
https://github.com/tprouvot/Salesforce-Inspector-reloaded/stargazers

# Local links inside docs/ follow mkdocs URL semantics, not filesystem paths:
# with use_directory_urls (the default), docs/x.md is published at /x/, so
# "../assets/img.png" correctly resolves to /assets/img.png on the site even
# though no assets/ directory exists at the repository root. lychee checks these
# as file paths and reports false positives; mkdocs validates them at build time.
^file://
